{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31571","headline":"辱绵州于中丞书信 · 李羣玉","name":"辱绵州于中丞书信","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一缄垂露到云林，中有孙阳念骥心。\n万木自凋山不动，百川皆旱海长深。\n风标想见瑶台鹤，诗韵如闻渌水琴。\n他日纵陪池上酌，已应难到暝猨吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}